LocalCue desktop
Copyright the LocalCue desktop contributors.

This project is a Tauri/Rust port of LocalCue (https://github.com/mdda/localcue),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The teleprompter UI, the character-offset
positioning (shared/textpos.js) and the control scheme originate from that project;
legacy/voice.py is kept unchanged as a reference for a future voice-follow port,
which in turn adapts ideas from promptme-ai (https://github.com/larsbaunwall/promptme-ai).
